# EzFlutter V2 — Cursor Rules

You are working on EzFlutter V2, a production-ready Flutter boilerplate.

## Architecture
- lib/core/ = Framework layer (DO NOT modify unless asked)
- lib/app/ = Application layer (this is where you work)

## Patterns
- Pages: @RoutePage() + ConsumerWidget in lib/app/pages/
- Models: @freezed + abstract class in lib/app/models/
- Services: @injectable in lib/app/services/
- Providers: @riverpod in lib/app/providers/
- Errors: Return Result<T>, never throw

## After adding codegen files
Run: dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs

## State Management
Riverpod 3.x with code generation. Use ref.watch() in widgets.

## DI
get_it + injectable. Access via getIt<Service>().

## Navigation
auto_route. Annotate pages with @RoutePage(). Add routes in lib/core/router/app_router.dart.
